          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chisha achiinjira ndani ya dzumba ra chifalume, achirya na kunwa, alafu achiamba, “Mzikeni hiye mchetu ariyelaniwa kpwa mana ni mwana mchetu wa mfalume.” ",
          "type": "text",
