        {
          "text": "Ariphouya kpwendamuambira Jehu mambo higo, ye waamba, “Hivi ndivyo Mwenyezi Mlungu arivyogomba kutsupira mtumishiwe Elija wa Tishibi achiamba, ‘Madiya gandarya mwiri wa Jezebeli kpwenye munda wa Jeziriili. ",
